<http://data.silknow.org/object/018e23a8-a4a7-3ab5-b648-1eb9a5933390/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of cream silk taffeta brocaded in coloured silks with a large central floral spray and two smaller ones. Linking the floral details is a self-coloured pattern of a cord with tassels and a pineapple flanked by ears of corn. The central spray is tied with a self-coloured ribbon and contains three heads of hops and there are more hops in the self-coloured pattern. \n\nIt is tabby brocaded with an additional flushing weft and has selvages with one green stripe and three outer cords."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/018e23a8-a4a7-3ab5-b648-1eb9a5933390> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/018e23a8-a4a7-3ab5-b648-1eb9a5933390/dimension/pattern/2>
